<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs Friday estimate 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs Friday estimate 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's est 100,000, Wk ago 90,000, Yr ago 97,000. Saturday's 20,000, 26,000, and 25,000 head. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 higher than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow to moderate for good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
